1
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,130
Rong A-52

2
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:17,039
As long as you help me get this done,

3
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,360
you will all be handsomely rewarded.

4
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,200
Whoever provides the most useful material

5
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,760
gets the biggest reward.

6
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:23,960
If

7
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,039
you're afraid of being exposed

8
00:01:25,039 --> 00:01:26,770
and want to leave the He family,

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,960
I promise

10
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:30,220
you can all come work for the Liang Group,

11
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,840
and your salary will be doubled.

12
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,840
But...

13
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:37,360
If anyone wants to snitch,

14
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,000
don't forget,

15
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,560
I have

16
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:44,680
your families' information.

17
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,280
Alright,

18
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,400
let's go.

19
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,520
Hurry up, He Shi.

20
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,079
Take your time, He Shi.

21
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,880
Strange.

22
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,440
Why do I feel like someone is watching me?

23
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,760
What,

24
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,920
you like being watched?

25
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,440
Wait a minute.

26
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,280
Come on, baby.

27
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:18,720
Recently,

28
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,560
someone anonymously tipped off our agency

29
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,920
about the secret affair
between Mrs. He of the He Group

30
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,600
and the eldest son,

31
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,440
He Shi.

32
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,040
Miss Liang is

33
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,170
quite resourceful.

34
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,480
If I tried to bribe the nanny,

35
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,880
it might not have worked,

36
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,280
because in the He family,

37
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,079
they would trust Mrs. He more.

38
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,000
But with the power of the Liang Group,

39
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,200
this matter

40
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,800
became much easier.

41
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,840
You've got some nerve.

42
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,760
I just got back from the hospital,

43
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:50,400
and you dare to cause such a scandal.

44
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,480
Master, I was wrong.

45
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,360
Where is that bastard He Shi?

46
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,010
Tell him to get out here.

47
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,920
I'll deal with him

48
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,200
today too.

49
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,680
What happened?

50
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,960
He Shi hasn't been back all night.

51
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,160
Haven't you all seen the news?

52
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,800
She has completely disgraced

53
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,320
our He family.

54
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,079
Speak.

55
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,839
When did this start?

56
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,280
Mrs. He has fainted.

57
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,160
Let me see.

58
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,120
Li Zhangxin,

59
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,400
you venomous woman!

60
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,840
Mrs. He, your skill at faking a faint

61
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,240
is truly impressive.

62
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,360
Bring me the whip.

63
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,400
Coming, Dad.

64
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:53,920
Here you go, Dad.

65
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,600
You...

66
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,280
Sir, I was wrong.

67
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:02,120
Please spare me, Sir!

68
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,200
I'll teach you a lesson!

69
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,040
Sir!

70
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,560
Sir!

71
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,220
-I'll beat you to death!
-Sir!

72
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,920
I've painstakingly stayed
by your side for over a decade.

73
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:18,600
Don't you remember
our past affection at all?

74
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,760
Shut up!

75
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,560
In ancient times,

76
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,760
you would have been drowned
in a pig basket.

77
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,680
From today on,

78
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,740
you are no longer Mrs. He
of the He family.

79
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,920
Get out of here!

80
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,480
I don't want to leave!

81
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,600
Sir,

82
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,800
please calm down!

83
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,159
I'm not leaving!

84
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,320
Fine,

85
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,840
just you wait!

86
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,800
Mr. He,

87
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,480
you bastard!

88
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,360
Are you satisfied now?

89
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,960
I know the butler is dead.

90
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,840
Where is he?

91
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,480
I won't tell you.

92
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,800
You've been beaten for a whole day,

93
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,120
and he hasn't shown up.

94
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,880
Do you think

95
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,500
he will still come to save you?

96
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,280
Get

97
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,480
lost!

98
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,440
I apologize.

99
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,520
My personal affairs

100
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,360
have taken up public resources.

101
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,240
I'd like to say

102
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,330
sorry to everyone here.

103
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,940
Actually, this relationship
wasn't my intention.

104
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,890
It was all because Zhang Xin

105
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,440
seduced me into sleeping with her

106
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,640
when I was young and naive.

107
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:59,820
I really didn't expect things
to turn out like this.

108
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,610
Please wait, Mr. He.

109
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,520
The stepmother trope becomes reality.

110
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,600
Do you have some sort of Oedipus complex?

111
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,360
What is Mr. He Senior's stance

112
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,760
on you fighting your own father
for a woman?

113
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,080
Yeah,

114
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:28,960
what is his stance?

115
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,690
Please say a few words. Tell us.

116
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,320
Mr. He,

117
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,700
It's all because Zhang Xin

118
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,040
seduced me into sleeping with her.

119
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,159
He Shi!

120
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:40,440
You bastard.

121
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,640
See how he saves his own skin?

122
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,520
Even now,

123
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,500
you're still taking his side.

124
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:54,320
Do you think I'm stupid?

125
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,560
If I tell you where the butler is,

126
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,480
not only will He Shi go to jail,

127
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,680
but I'll be implicated too.

128
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,760
Fine.

129
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,800
Then you can just tear each other apart.

130
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,360
Damn He Shi.

131
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:21,080
How much for this watch?

132
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,440
In all of Rongcheng,

133
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,760
only the eldest son
of the He family has this watch.

134
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,880
Could you be

135
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,360
his new lover?

136
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,320
Cut the crap. How much?

137
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,460
I can't take it.

138
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,960
Why?

139
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:38,760
This watch is fake.

140
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,720
It's fake.

141
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,000
He Shi,

142
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,240
you bastard!

143
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,320
I shouldn't have trusted Zhang Xin.

144
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,080
Our He family

145
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,120
is ruined by her.

146
00:08:58,520 --> 00:08:59,200
Dad,

147
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,040
Zhang Xin is behind all this.

148
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,960
Don't be so hard on yourself.

149
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,560
Mei,

150
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,720
I've failed you and your mother.

151
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,960
I promise you,

152
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,680
from now on,

153
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,280
I won't see any other women.

154
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,360
Zhang Xin

155
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,240
doesn't deserve to be

156
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,040
on our He family tree.

157
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,260
Thank you, Dad.

158
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,680
You don't still resent me, do you?

159
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,000
I've never blamed you.

160
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,440
Dad!

161
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,370
Are you okay?

162
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,580
Dad, are you okay? Dad!

163
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,360
Dad!

164
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,640
Dad!

165
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,140
Somebody help!

166
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,240
Somebody help!

167
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,720
Good things happen to good people.

168
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,760
Dad will be fine.

169
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:16,330
Miss, Second Young Master,

170
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:18,160
the recent turmoil might have

171
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,620
taken a toll on the Master.

172
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:21,040
Given his current condition,

173
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:23,700
he needs a bone marrow transplant
immediately.

174
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,720
Your bone marrow

175
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,440
is a perfect match for his.

176
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,240
This is the surgery consent form.

177
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,300
Please take a look.

178
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,640
You will be responsible
for any complications

179
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:36,810
during the surgery.

180
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:43,210
Don't you want to read it carefully first?

181
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,960
It's a major surgery, after all.

182
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,040
I'll do anything

183
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,520
as long as it can save Dad.
